---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Blog
description: Ink talk, style guides, and behind-the-pick stories from Tattoo Artist Review.
---
<header class="page-header">
  <div class="page-header-inner">
    <p class="page-kicker">Ink Talk</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">The <span style="color:var(--gold-bright)">Blog</span></h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle">Style breakdowns, city scenes, and the stories behind the picks.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  {%- set posts = collections.posts -%}
  {%- if posts and posts.length %}
  <div class="feed">
    {%- for item in posts %}
      {% include "partials/feed-card.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  {%- else %}
  <p style="text-align:center; color: var(--muted);">First posts coming in hot.</p>
  {%- endif %}
</section>

{% include "partials/contact-band.njk" %}
